  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="11">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Iudex">Iudex</ref> 11</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Oft eac ða ðwyran deman for heora gitsungae þone dom geuferiað oððe hyne awendað 7 ne geendiað ná þa spæce, ær heora seod bið afylled; 7 þan þonne hy demað, ne scewiað hy ná þa spæce, ac þa medsceatas.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Often also, through greed, wicked judges defer or pervert cases, and don’t complete [them] before their purses are filled; and then they make determinations, not considering the cases, but [considering] the bribes.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Sepe etiam praui iudices iudicium peruertunt uel respectant et non finiunt causam, donec uultus eorum impleatur; et quando indicant, non opera, sed munera considerant.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
